# "Target tapped creature" is any player's (CR 115.1): Bot1's own Ornithopter attacked on turn 3 and is tapped in the second main phase, so the
# Lullaby may destroy it, and Bot1 gains 2 (20 -> 22). Bot2's untapped Ornithopter is no legal target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Ornithopter
Eriette's Lullaby
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Eriette's Lullaby.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Hand.Eriette's Lullaby.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

